 located in Nueva Andalucia in a very prestigious community named La Cerquilla. \n\nThis Villa has been created with the highest quality standarts and top quality materials in order to ensure a full luxury experience. \nOnce you enter this property you will immeadiately be impressed by the entrance hall with double height ceilling leading to the large open-plan living area. \nOn the upper level of the house you will find the spacious bedrooms with amazing views to Los Naranjos Golf. \nAnd downstairs you will find a large entertainment room with a TV area and many possibilities ‌to ‌customize ‌it ‌to ‌your ‌desires. \n\nWith ‌an amazing ‌tropical garden, several chill out ‌areas ‌and ‌an ‌amazing ‌infinity pool, this estate ‌truly ‌is ‌what ‌your ‌heart ‌longs ‌for."},"features":{"es":["Cerca de Golf","Sur","Excelente","Privada","Aire Acondicionado","Jardín","Piscina","Terraza Cubierta","Ascensor","Terraza Privada","Privado","Privado","Lujo"],"en":["Close To Golf","South","Excellent","Private","Air Conditioning","Garden","Pool","Covered Terrace","Lift","Private Terrace","Private","Private","Luxury"]},"piscina":true,"parking":true,"jardin":true,"estado":"Available","gps":{},"energia":{"CO2Rated":"","CO2Value":"","EnergyRated":"","EnergyValue":"","Image":""},"gastos":{"comunidad":"4,656","ibi":"6,634","basura":"306"}}